      "id": "claim_86a819edab6c4e76bdd15e8aa1a81ca2",
      "statement": "The per-package test command is a Vite+ task rather than a package.json script so the scratch paths vitest writes and reads back (node_modules/.vite results, .vite-temp config loader modules, .wrangler validate trees) can be excluded workspace-wide from the fingerprint; the direct script is named test:run because vp forbids a task and a script sharing a name.",
      "evidence": [
        {
