    {
      "id": "claim_f44b2bdb3c19444fbe1d4a56223c0b8f",
      "statement": "Every cached test command runs under scripts/with-timeout.ts: an idle-output watchdog (60s default) plus a total wall-clock cap kill the whole process tree and exit 124 when either fires, because nothing else bounds a wedged run — vitest's timeouts die with the worker and a killed workerd child wedges the vitest pool forever.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://scripts/with-timeout.ts#L1-L25",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:5c06d5c1d73a2e5673f308fb9b70571b6541b44d8d023ca65402d65e9093eb67:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_c1d0d058fd0043678a9524be7d15aa78",
      "statement": "Packages whose tests must run in workerd load scripts/assert-workerd.ts as a setupFiles entry, which throws unless navigator.userAgent is Cloudflare-Workers — without it, a vitest-pool-workers pool that fails to start silently falls back to Node and suites that import no cloudflare module stay green while testing the wrong runtime.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://scripts/assert-workerd.ts#L1-L13",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:e26e3c5347e92c7f24220e48b95cd5172a14a3bd53859bc529157967f80922b4:"
        }
