    },
    {
      "id": "claim_0a389b1d2a09481ca5fa9c6b3a95faa0",
      "statement": "gatekeeper-cloudflare runs two vitest projects: a workerd-pool project for coverage built on RpcTarget/RpcStub/DurableObject props, with the gatekeeper DO driven through a TestHooks Durable Object because a DurableObjectClass carrying ctx.props is only reachable via ctx.facets, and a cheaper Node project for pure logic; the pool's compatibility settings are kept in step with wrangler.jsonc.",
