      "id": "claim_a77a4ab2b9404694834e38ace98f5abe",
      "statement": "The integration-tests toolkit boots workshop-backend plus any set of gatekeepers as real Workers under wrangler's createTestHarness (patching wrangler.jsonc in memory), with three source-only modules: harness.ts (parameterized over gatekeepers), network-interceptor.ts (patches globalThis.fetch, throws on unmatched requests so tests cannot reach the internet), and rpc-client.ts (Cap'n Web over WebSocket to /api, with an ObserverConfigRecorder answering overseer callbacks from a scripted queue).",
